  "blocksOrielShowed": [
    "Computed by Oriel from the index and its change log: Counted by State, highest first",
    "Computed by Oriel from the index and its change log: Done, counted by week, running, since Sep 2. Least-squares line over 7 whole weeks, R² 0.94, 0.8 a week. At that rate the 9 left get there around Jan 14 (Dec 21 – Mar 16, 80%), if no more are added",
    "Computed by Oriel from the index and its change log, where State is In progress: Item, Assignee, Estimate, Days in its state",
